 2 │ {# djangofmt: ignore[] #}
   · ────────────┬────────────
   ·             ╰── here
 3 │ <form method="yes"></form>
   ╰────
  help: Use `{# djangofmt: ignore[rule, ...] #}` or `{# djangofmt: file-ignore[rule, ...] #}`

